We are building a blockchain-based medical record RAG system.

Rules:

- Build only one feature at a time.
- Never generate more than one module.
- Keep the code simple and modular.
- Use FastAPI for backend.
- Use React for frontend.
- Use SQLite.
- Use ChromaDB.
- Use Hyperledger Besu.
- Never store medical records on the blockchain.
- Explain before making major architectural changes.